NSCR for the N-Queens Problem

Associated publication:

Omid Moghimi and Amin Amini
"A Novel Approach for Solving the N-Queen Problem Using a Non-Sequential
Conflict Resolution Algorithm"
Electronics 2024, 13(20), 4065
https://doi.org/10.3390/electronics13204065

The associated paper's author-contribution statement attributes
conceptualization and algorithm development to Omid Moghimi; validation to
Omid Moghimi and Amin Amini; and formal analysis and methodology to Amin
Amini.

This repository contains a clean reference reconstruction informed by the
published paper and a recovered historical C# experimental draft. It is not
claimed to be the exact source tree used to produce the published experimental
results.

